        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Karrin Murphy, Connie Murphy, Jim Butcher\n- Works: The Dresden Files, Storm Front\n- Companies: Roc Books\n- Topics: contemporary fantasy, mystery, television adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Jim Butcher wrote The Dresden Files as a series of contemporary fantasy and mystery novels.\n- Roc Books published Storm Front, the first novel in The Dresden Files series, in 2000.\n- Karrin Murphy is a major character in Jim Butcher's The Dresden Files series.\n- Karrin Murphy appears as Connie Murphy in the television series based on The Dresden Files novels.",
